Generator script:
Create scripts/generate-main-engine-diagram.ts.
It should generate a valid mxGraphModel with:
- Entry node
- Knowledgebase query node
- Decision node
- Prompt node
- Route node
- Terminal node
- Edges between them
- All required metadata populated

Initial map flow:
entry.start
  -> kb.query
  -> decision.route
  -> prompt.generate
  -> route.execute
  -> terminal.done

Acceptance criteria:
- App can load /diagrams/main-engine.drawio
- Parser returns a valid DiagramGraph
- Runtime starts at entry.start
- User can step through the flow
- User can click a node to jump
- Godmode inspector displays metadata
- Prompt text updates based on active node
- Knowledgebase references resolve to local KB paths
- PNG snapshot is generated by workflow
- All code is modular and ready for future AI model integration

Implementation constraints:
- Use TypeScript.
- Prefer React components.
- Avoid vendor lock-in.
- Do not hardcode business logic into UI components.
- Keep diagram parsing, routing, prompting, and KB resolving separate.
- Add clear comments where future AI execution will plug in.
- Do not remove existing application code.
- Add this as a new engine layer.

Final implementation objective:
Build the base routing layer for a diagram-driven 2D playground where the knowledgebase, prompt engine, and game engine all share the same visual map as their source of truth.
